# Ch2, VERBATIM: "Unparenthesized -x ** 2 is rejected as ambiguous". A CLEAN
# REJECTION is the correct outcome here; the expected stdout below is what the
# `-(x ** 2)` reading would print, recorded so the cell has a value to compare.
# Expected: -9
void main():
    int x = 3
    print(f"{-x ** 2}")
